      "body": "## Summary\n\nExact backport of #5599 onto `release/0.4`.\n\n`torch_checkpointing==0.1.1`, introduced by #5596, passes a single `CallbackArgs` object to `pre_finalize_callback`. Update the TorchTitan callback to use that API and read the staged path from `args.path`.\n\nThis fixes the release-branch Pyrefly failure and the corresponding runtime callback mismatch.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Stable patch ID matches #5599 exactly.\n- `pyrefly check torchtitan/components/checkpointer/torch_checkpointing.py` (0 errors)\n- `pytest -q tests/unit_tests/cpu/components/checkpointer/test_torch_checkpointing.py` (45 passed, 11 subtests passed)\n- All other applicable scoped pre-commit hooks passed.",
